sequenceDiagram
    actor T as Testeur
    participant F as Formulaire Anomalie
    participant AC as AiController
    participant AGS as AnomalieGraviteService
    participant OL as OllamaChatbotService
    participant LLM as Ollama LLM
    participant AN as AnomalieController
    participant DB as Base de Donnees

    T->>F: Saisit titre anomalie
    T->>F: Saisit description
    Note over F: Debounce 800ms
    F->>AC: POST /api/ai/suggerer-gravite
    AC->>AGS: suggererAvecConfiance(titre, desc)
    AGS->>OL: sendMessage(prompt)
    OL->>LLM: POST /api/generate
    LLM-->>OL: CRITIQUE perte de donnees
    OL-->>AGS: String reponse
    AGS->>AGS: parseGravite + calculerConfiance
    AGS-->>AC: GravitePrediction CRITIQUE 92%
    AC-->>F: 200 OK graviteSuggeree CRITIQUE
    F->>F: Affiche badge IA suggere CRITIQUE 92%
    T->>F: Accepte ou modifie la gravite
    T->>F: Soumet le formulaire
    F->>AN: POST /api/anomalies
    AN->>DB: save Anomalie
    AN-->>F: 201 Created
